{"id":"n61497-1-8","stage":5,"title":"사양 · 谢绝","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61497-1-8-1","ko":"이렇게 귀한 물건을 그냥 받을 수는 없습니다.","zh":"这么珍贵的东西，我怎么能就这样收下呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"귀한","meaning":"贵重，宝贵","explanation":"귀하다：贵重，宝贵；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"귀하다","audio":"/audio/f995e55a5562f14d0314.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37051","senseId":"3","lemma":"귀하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀한","audio":"/audio/bdd69250d81be096d8f1.mp3"}},{"text":"물건을","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건을","audio":"/audio/9f0ff175ca9f394f7144.mp3"}},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"받을","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받을","audio":"/audio/1ce65fb87a94df252095.mp3"}},{"text":"수는","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수는","audio":"/audio/0ae6625dd24dc5dcc565.mp3"}},{"text":"없습니다.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없습니다","audio":"/audio/795d658e7bfcf08e6bc8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"f995e55a5562f14d","term":"귀하다","zh":"贵重，宝贵","audio":"/audio/f995e55a5562f14d0314.mp3","entryId":"37051","definition":"价值很高，很珍贵。","pronunciation":["귀ː하다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/552cccb7a053eab71bc1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61497-1-8-2","ko":"괜찮으니 사양 말고 받게.","zh":"没关系，别客气，收下吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"괜찮으니","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮으니","audio":"/audio/283c134fc00697cb646a.mp3"}},{"text":"사양","meaning":"谢绝，客气","explanation":"사양：谢绝，客气","readings":[{"term":"사양","audio":"/audio/fcf6c8fa55f99c38e05b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61497","senseId":"1","lemma":"사양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사양","audio":"/audio/fcf6c8fa55f99c38e05b.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不做","explanation":"말다：不做；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고","audio":"/audio/1473c8e39b00e08bbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"받게.","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；게：结合语境表示劝告、目的或反问等，常用于非敬语交谈。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받게","audio":"/audio/da2d9df79e612ff4486f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"没关系，无所谓，可以","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"不用担心或没有问题，可以允许。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"fcf6c8fa55f99c38","term":"사양","zh":"谢绝，客气","audio":"/audio/fcf6c8fa55f99c38e05b.mp3","entryId":"61497","definition":"谦让或不接受的态度；或向他人让步。","pronunciation":["사양"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不做","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不做某事；或指不是。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/461c01c505e2ca96097c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61497","label":"国立国语院韩国语